! ============================================================
! Rigid Scale Strategy
! ============================================================
! Uniform displacement for all modes (constant step size).
!
! Formula:
!   alpha_k = ref_scale   (same value for every mode)
!
! Where:
!   ref_scale = step size in Bohr
! ============================================================

!normalmode
!symmetry=auto
!ref_scale=0.03

!fakekey
